  aciklama:
  - "{{isim}} seni telvelerinde senden ya\u015F\xE7a b\xFCy\xFCk biri ile, bir kap\u0131
    a\u011Fz\u0131nda konu\u015Furken g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Konu\u015Fma esnas\u0131nda
    ba\u015F\u0131n\u0131 tutuyor olu\u015Fun ve bu g\xF6rsellerin hemen yak\u0131n\u0131nda
    beliren \"K\" harfi, iki ilgin\xE7 detay. Bu ki\u015Fiden, e\u011Fitiminle ilgili
    ad\u0131n\u0131n i\xE7inde \"K\" harfi ge\xE7en bir s\u0131nav ya da ders hakk\u0131nda
    tavsiye al\u0131yor gibisin. S\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131l\u0131 oldu\u011Fun ve stresten
    dolay\u0131 ba\u015F a\u011Fr\u0131lar\u0131 ya\u015F\u0131yor olabilece\u011Fin
    de yine fincan\u0131ndan ald\u0131\u011F\u0131m\u0131z haberler aras\u0131nda.
    \u0130\xE7ini ferah tutmal\u0131s\u0131n, \xE7\xFCnk\xFC orta vadede bu sorunlar
    \xE7\xF6z\xFCmleriyle bulu\u015Facaklar."
